        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By operating our technology platform in-house, we are able to focus a greater portion of our technology spend on product innovation, avoid costly maintenance of legacy systems, and reduce or eliminate reliance on third-party vendors in areas such as transaction processing, financial ledgering, technology and product development, and technical operations.",
